      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/4da419/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2013-01-15T18:37:48.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The Other day I put Wrest the Mind on Voss's flagship, and on Visionary's next turn, i put Visionary in Telekinetic Cocoon. &nbsp;Basically I was playing it to where each time i redirected damage via Wrest the Mind, the flagship would take 3 psychic damage, but Visionary wouldn't take any damage because of the cocoon. &nbsp;Did I play this right? &nbsp;Telekinetic Cocoon doesn't allow Visionary to use powers, but Wrest the Mind doesn't have the \"<strong>Power:\"&nbsp;</strong>text on it.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>It seemed a bit too powerful especially since I had Haka hoarding all the minions under Savage Mana so that there was nothing in the villain trash for the flagship to bring back in the game.</p><p>Thanks for any replies.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
