      "raw": "<p>The Other day I put Wrest the Mind on Voss&#39;s flagship, and on Visionary&#39;s next turn, i put Visionary in Telekinetic Cocoon. &nbsp;Basically I was playing it to where each time i redirected damage via Wrest the Mind, the flagship would take 3 psychic damage, but Visionary wouldn&#39;t take any damage because of the cocoon. <u>&nbsp;Did I play this right?</u> &nbsp;Telekinetic Cocoon doesn&#39;t allow Visionary to use powers, but Wrest the Mind doesn&#39;t have the &quot;<strong>Power:&quot;&nbsp;</strong>text on it.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>It seemed a bit too powerful especially since I had Haka hoarding all the minions under Savage Mana so that there was nothing in the villain trash for the flagship to bring back in the game.</p><p>Thanks for any replies.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
